+# Review: retry on gateway timeout
+
+The retry is bounded (3 attempts), re-raises on the last and passes `key=order["id"]` on every attempt, so `payments.charge` returns the first receipt instead of charging again when a timed-out call had gone through. Safe to repeat.
+
+VERDICT: approve
